 "text": "Hey, good to have you with us. Keep a few heavy rocks on each side of the tent, and hang bear repel on the poles. Only use it where the window is completely closed. At least ten feet, and as far as possible. Bears are incredibly curious and strong. Do not stare and get out of your tent quickly. Bears fear into freedom. If you see one, stay where you are and talk to it through the tent. Bear sprinkling is also worth having at the site, and carry it if you hear bears nearby at night.",
